From: Ely Office
Subject: Replace All answers with how many it replaced

- The find bar of ElyDoc and ElyTable said nothing after Replace
  All (R23.9a, #127); the kernel only returned found or not found.
- Writer and Calc now set the result of .uno:ExecuteSearch for
  Replace All to the count replaced, zero included: Writer its
  matches, Calc the cells changed. A search Writer stops early
  still answers false.

